{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44302","headline":"句 · 元淳","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弟兄俱已尽，松柏问何人。\n闻道茂陵山水好，碧溪流水有桃源。\n赤城峭壁无人到，丹竈芝田有鹤来。\n三千宫女露蛾眉，笑煮黄金日月迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元淳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}